      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "exclusiveGateway GW_Outcome",
      "prov:value": "Four answers, and they do four different things — which is the whole reason this gateway now exists. Until 2026-09-23 the adjudication flowed straight to Task_Apply, so the process ASKED which side wins and then always applied the remote. The judgement was made and discarded. Bean `bvuk`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
